	(text_box "P82B715 resistor values can be calculated from the information in the datasheet.\n\nCapacitor values (and sizes) from recommended layout\n\nFor each bus section, the pullup resistor is calculated as:\nR = 1 μs/(Cdevice + Cwiring)\nwhere\n• Cdevice = Sum of any connected device capacitances\n• Cwiring = Total wiring and stray capacitance on the bus section\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 217.424 66.802 0)
		(size 44.958 30.5285)
